From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 13/23] platform: padre: add the TWSI I2C controller

Adds drivers/platform/padre for the ReadyNAS Duo v1 on-board devices,
starting with the SoC "TWSI" I2C controller, ported from the GPL 2.6.17
driver with the same exported access functions (i2c_readb_idx...,
CMOS_READ/WRITE) used by the clock, sensor and Ethernet drivers.
---
 arch/sparc/include/asm/padre_i2c.h |  19 +++
 drivers/platform/Kconfig           |   2 +
 drivers/platform/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/platform/padre/Kconfig     |  12 ++
 drivers/platform/padre/Makefile    |   2 +
 drivers/platform/padre/padre_i2c.c | 197 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 233 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/sparc/include/asm/padre_i2c.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/platform/padre/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 drivers/platform/padre/Makefile
